-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"b97fa8a3d468cac1180f02925d471b2c196e3048adc476a1fe3e3f7bedfa6346","event_uuid":"d6f158d9-6bc4-464f-8433-3c8304d26608","position":{"commit_sha":"2ace29186f126fcb76203a8f1e5a345808eb96e4","position":"1786786563796030001-d6f158d9-6bc4-464f-8433-3c8304d26608"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"c4acfda97a92ef27fcbda7fa3f92260675f8cf2d50fb792c611d177e603cae94","event_uuid":"628f5703-f416-4d84-8ec1-3749ab3f0931","position":{"commit_sha":"b73b3118545475406b672f14c8154c39183c13ba","position":"1786786575226562001-628f5703-f416-4d84-8ec1-3749ab3f0931"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Final CI-runtime investigation stocktake. Objective remains an average Gerrit Verify wall clock of 20-30 minutes with unchanged fidelity/behavioral/contract coverage and lower runner occupancy.\n\nLanded improvements during the session: coverage now runs only on Ubuntu 3.13; the complexity lock moved from four matrix cells to one job (206 runner-seconds removed); bridge schedule parsing was hoisted from all 1,440 minutes; AST provenance is indexed once (cold scan 3.26s to 0.81s); redundant Pandoc subprocess renders were replaced with static expected outputs while the complete real-Pandoc corpus replay moved to External Integration; repeated fixture repositories became isolated templates (103.416 measured worker-seconds removed); the reverse-DNS editor fixture 35.013s long pole was eliminated; docs-only routing retains generated-doc, drift, reference-validation, and other documentation gates while skipping code suites; an organic non-doc change verified the full suite still runs; superseded same-change runs cancel promptly.\n\nLatest clean five-run series before the final experiment: mean end-to-end 31m28.8s, median 31m20s, macOS job mean 27m56.2s, mean time through macOS completion 30m13.4s, and final-vote queue mean 65.8s. Therefore the target is not yet proven. No normal macOS test exceeded 20s in the captured organic control; the remaining N=3000 import benchmark ranged around 19.69s hosted and 20.19-21.63s locally, with 13.69s attributed to its 24 contractually required Git add/commit pairs.\n\nFinal experiment: APFS RAM-disk placement had strong maintained-OSS precedent (Apple Git CI, Aeron, Git performance guidance) but failed the predeclared rebar retention oracle. Exact no-RAM control 31868300174: default 17m26s, macOS job 20m36s. Treatments: 18m43.77s, 20m54.61s, 18m26s, and final run 31873067707 at 20m00.60s default. Every treatment was 5.5-20% slower; recursive reporting/release added 71-98s. The experiment was fully reverted in Gerrit 1806, merged as 7d908fbbc6da12f8e274b3ef1e3a2357377799ef. Final run 31873067707 was green, macOS 24m42s, LLM-Review +1, Verified +1, zero unresolved comments. It also replicated the repaired owner-nonwritable snapshot cleanup and nested-pytest cache hygiene on the trusted-main workflow. Ticket unplayful-inaccurate-muskrat received signed plan PASS plus completion PASS and was closed.\n\nOpen disposition: inedible-subsimious-brahmancow remains the parent occupancy/runtime goal. panpsychic-clever-hawk records 4/4 direction-level OSS consensus for eliminating per-test Git subprocesses, projected around 75s macOS wall / 207 runner-seconds, but no fidelity-preserving implementation reached consensus; do not auto-implement. ravenous-beribboned-walleye retains the exact N=3000/6,000-event/24-commit contract and needs a disposition based on hosted evidence versus the local long pole. Several organic full runs after the no-RAM revert are required before claiming the 20-30 minute average. Per operator direction, pause here and take stock rather than start another remediation or control run.","timestamp":1786783829695184001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"{\"exception_type\": \"TimeoutException\", \"message\": \"error sending request for url (https://yandex.com/search/site/?text=[REDACTED_B64]&web=1&searchid=5708280) > operation timed out\", \"model\": \"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8\"}","timestamp":1786786575226562001}],"created_at":1786783801881427001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"d87d4187-d9ae-407e-b51a-e60a7e16b6c5","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"4f50-b1f2-78af-4326"},{"link_uuid":"d6f158d9-6bc4-464f-8433-3c8304d26608","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"69b2-2488-6008-42d1"}],"description":"","env_id":"0993f6a8-7a6a-4707-a671-c5bbb2691444","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","4f50-b1f2-78af-4326"],["relates_to","69b2-2488-6008-42d1"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"f389-657d-4c03-4e5f","ticket_type":"session_log","title":"CI runtime investigation final stocktake; RAM-disk experiment rejected and reverted in Gerrit 1806","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["ae191f4c-f63b-4673-83dd-753491800b53","d87d4187-d9